Welcome to my Sandbox :)

You can find the code I use for my graduation project here.
I am modelling the Stratified Inclined Duct (SID) experiment including Stokes particles.

The code for the SID without particles can be found here: [froude.c](froude.c). The Froude number is calculated to measure the stability of the flow.
The code used for the mesh study is included [here](inertial_mesh.c). I measure flow statistics: average velocity in the duct and the gradient of the buoyancy field in the duct and particle statistics: the average buoyancy at the position of the particles.